   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Lightning Discharge</em></p>\n<p>You have learned how to further manipulate your lightning. On a hit with a melee attack using a weapon it also gains a charge, and as a bonus action you can release a bolt of lightning between the weapon and yourself. Those caught in that bolt of lightning must make a Dexterity save, taking your <em>Lightning Discharge</em> damage on a failure or half as much on a success.</p>",
